---
[v1] net: phy: as21xxx: update driver to v2.5.3

Update the PHY driver to the latest version.

---
v1: Add support for AN8833X, rename the driver to as2xxxx, and
    update the PHY driver to v2.5.3.
---

From 16707fbcf254298a0092deb5c3fd22adcd50dd13 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bo-Cun Chen <bc-bocun.chen@mediatek.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 16:58:22 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: phy: as21xxx: update driver to v2.5.3

Changes from Firmware Version 2.5.2:
1. 1G EEE issue of slave mode is fixed.

Changes from Firmware Version 2.5.1:
1. Power consumption for 10G/5G/2.5G EEE slave mode is optimized.

Changes from Firmware Version 2.5.0:
1. 1000Base-T performance is optimized.
2. SYNCE feature is optimized.
3. 10GBase-T EEE issue is fixed.
4. 10GBase-T IOP performance is optimized.
5. LED force ON issue is fixed.
6. 100Base-Tx amplitude adjusting requirement for testmode is
   implemented.

Changes from Firmware Version 2.4.0:
1. I2C flash upgrade is implemented.
2. SYNCE feature is implemented (only J version supports internal
   jitter clean).
3. Compensation of Tjunction reading is implemented.
4. NG testmode5 is updated.
5. Uart baudrate is changed to 115200 (previous GUI can not be used
   for firmware 2.5.0).
6. serdes polarity setting is supported.
7. Indication for success firmware loading is implemented.

Changes from Firmware Version 2.3.1:
1. Stage1 of power saving is complete.
2. ESD performance is improved.

Changes from Firmware Version 2.3.0:
1. auto-EEE of eth side is implemented.
2. Testmode template of 100Base-Tx and 1000Base-T is improved.
3. Half duplex of 1G/100M/10M is implemented.
4. Testmode of SerDes is implemented.

Changes from Firmware Version 2.2.0:
1. First version for AN8833X B0 chip. Note: firmware version ≥ 2.3.0
   does NOT support AN8833X A0 chip anymore.

Changes from Firmware Version 2.1.0:
1. I2C interface is implemented.
2. Serdes testmode is implemented.
3. Wake on lan feature is implemented.
4. Interrupt request is implemented.

Changes from Firmware Version 2.0.3:
1. Customer configuration feature is implemented.
2. Packet counters debugging feature is implemented.
3. disable / enable phy feature is implemented.
4. LED option in 10G / none 10G mode is implemented.
5. Auto-MDI/MDIX,MDI,MDIX configuration is supported.
6. Serdes TX FIR TAP adaptation is supported.
7. SYNCE feature is implemented.
8. Testmode for 10G/5G/2.5G/1G/100M is implemented.

Signed-off-by: Bo-Cun Chen <bc-bocun.chen@mediatek.com>
